    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720120/extras/1559c36faa3f45c795769f3a9b2bcfe8.avif?t=1752821970\" width=616 height=346 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720120/extras/24f223eae8857bf1f54130dcfcaf46b5.avif?t=1752821970\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Sharp movement mechanics</strong> (Strafe, dash dodge, wall jump, rocket boosting, and bunny hop), allowing you to keep building momentum at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons for all aiming styles</strong> (Tracking, Flicking, Projectiles). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many maps and game modes</strong> (JMP, Team DM / FFA, CTF*, KOTH*)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720120/extras/3a90f844fa2df98cfb2ad5283a5065ec.avif?t=1752821970\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create servers easily </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server browsing for server made public</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Importable sprays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable players outlines</strong>* </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable weapon skins</strong>* </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Game modes and functionnality currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720120/extras/132cce882093c54061976ca392f113df.avif?t=1752821970\" width=616 height=75 /></span>Bullet Speed takes inspiration from early Source games and classics like Quake / Unreal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all in about the raw, unfiltered joy of running, gunning, and outsmarting your opponents in meticulously designed arenas that serve as the canvas for your clips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement isn't just a means to an end; it's an art form. <strong>Strafe</strong>, <strong>dash dodge</strong>, <strong>wall jump</strong>, <strong>rocket boosting</strong>, and<strong> bunny hop</strong> your way to victory, all while unleashing a barrage of bullets that would make even the most seasoned players sweat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a competitive fragger or a casual gamer looking for a quick adrenaline fix, Bullet Speed is your ticket to unadulterated fun. Put on a good playlist, grab your favorite weapon and jump in to let the bullets fly.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720120/extras/1559c36faa3f45c795769f3a9b2bcfe8.avif?t=1752821970\" width=616 height=346 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720120/extras/24f223eae8857bf1f54130dcfcaf46b5.avif?t=1752821970\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Sharp movement mechanics</strong> (Strafe, dash dodge, wall jump, rocket boosting, and bunny hop), allowing you to keep building momentum at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons for all aiming styles</strong> (Tracking, Flicking, Projectiles). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many maps and game modes</strong> (JMP, Team DM / FFA, CTF*, KOTH*)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720120/extras/3a90f844fa2df98cfb2ad5283a5065ec.avif?t=1752821970\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create servers easily </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server browsing for server made public</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Importable sprays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable players outlines</strong>* </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable weapon skins</strong>* </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Game modes and functionnality currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720120/extras/132cce882093c54061976ca392f113df.avif?t=1752821970\" width=616 height=75 /></span>Bullet Speed takes inspiration from early Source games and classics like Quake / Unreal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all in about the raw, unfiltered joy of running, gunning, and outsmarting your opponents in meticulously designed arenas that serve as the canvas for your clips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement isn't just a means to an end; it's an art form. <strong>Strafe</strong>, <strong>dash dodge</strong>, <strong>wall jump</strong>, <strong>rocket boosting</strong>, and<strong> bunny hop</strong> your way to victory, all while unleashing a barrage of bullets that would make even the most seasoned players sweat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a competitive fragger or a casual gamer looking for a quick adrenaline fix, Bullet Speed is your ticket to unadulterated fun. Put on a good playlist, grab your favorite weapon and jump in to let the bullets fly.</p>",
    "short_description": "Bullet speed is a lightning fast paced arena shooter seeing blood fueled robotic avatars cracked on adrenaline shooting each other. Move fast. Kill with style. Repeat.",
